WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.973
Two twenty pesewa coins are worth forty pesewas.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.208
Five twenty pesewa coins make one hundred pesewas.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.485
Two fifty pesewa coins also make one hundred pesewas.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:15.076
One hundred pesewas equal one Ghana cedi.
